    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crabmeat</strong> is a first-person-point-and-click-survival-horror game from one of the creators of KILLBUG, Screencheat, JUSTICE SUCKS and Feather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Debt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an indebted prisoner of the Fuedostate tasked with crabbing for the rare southern king crabs in order to pay for your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/d3c764367dda4fd21e645216bd827dc6.poster.avif?t=1750901271\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/d3c764367dda4fd21e645216bd827dc6.webm?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/d3c764367dda4fd21e645216bd827dc6.mp4?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Icy Southern Wasteland in your government issued crabbing vessel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bait, place, winch and empty traps with the help of various stations on the ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental blend of First Person and Point and Click gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself and the ship from the denizens of the sea</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short 2-3 hour experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crew the advanced crabbing vessel alone, maintain its components and navigate to bountiful shores.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/99629a2e155471398d7f75f2a69b218d.poster.avif?t=1750901271\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/99629a2e155471398d7f75f2a69b218d.webm?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/99629a2e155471398d7f75f2a69b218d.mp4?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Crabs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Crab are not the only crustaceans you'll encounter in the Southern wasteland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/3b20d357e16622caa1e9d1a999a9035d.poster.avif?t=1750901271\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/3b20d357e16622caa1e9d1a999a9035d.webm?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/3b20d357e16622caa1e9d1a999a9035d.mp4?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sea</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this frigid place will you find freedom or you end?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/6b0dba61093152381a942f85db9f875f.poster.avif?t=1750901271\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/6b0dba61093152381a942f85db9f875f.webm?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/6b0dba61093152381a942f85db9f875f.mp4?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crabmeat</strong> is a first-person-point-and-click-survival-horror game from one of the creators of KILLBUG, Screencheat, JUSTICE SUCKS and Feather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Debt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an indebted prisoner of the Fuedostate tasked with crabbing for the rare southern king crabs in order to pay for your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/d3c764367dda4fd21e645216bd827dc6.poster.avif?t=1750901271\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/d3c764367dda4fd21e645216bd827dc6.webm?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/d3c764367dda4fd21e645216bd827dc6.mp4?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Icy Southern Wasteland in your government issued crabbing vessel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bait, place, winch and empty traps with the help of various stations on the ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental blend of First Person and Point and Click gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself and the ship from the denizens of the sea</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short 2-3 hour experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crew the advanced crabbing vessel alone, maintain its components and navigate to bountiful shores.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/99629a2e155471398d7f75f2a69b218d.poster.avif?t=1750901271\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/99629a2e155471398d7f75f2a69b218d.webm?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/99629a2e155471398d7f75f2a69b218d.mp4?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Crabs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Crab are not the only crustaceans you'll encounter in the Southern wasteland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/3b20d357e16622caa1e9d1a999a9035d.poster.avif?t=1750901271\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/3b20d357e16622caa1e9d1a999a9035d.webm?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/3b20d357e16622caa1e9d1a999a9035d.mp4?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sea</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this frigid place will you find freedom or you end?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/6b0dba61093152381a942f85db9f875f.poster.avif?t=1750901271\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/6b0dba61093152381a942f85db9f875f.webm?t=1750901271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671850/extras/6b0dba